      "value": "Yea my guess is what they did to address the difference between standing and lying down from the open beta triggers a quick recalibration which is causing this issue when there are not enough trackers to calibrate into FBT.\n\nIt's about time they officially supported switching at runtime. The game does a great job of switching, has been this way for some time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
