      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This greatly affects all users that sleep in VRChat. Everyone is going to pretty much be guaranteed to snap back into 3pt tracking while laying down and raising their head up. The change of automatically putting you into 3pt tracking when trackers turn off does more harm than good, since there's no other way to \"freeze\" yourself in place anymore. This should be reverted or changed so that users have the option of doing it manually by hitting the calibrate button which would switch the user back into 3pt tracking, instead of it being done automatically for us.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d83d842b611ef17ecf09281",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5c1126e60289ad7789094976",
