      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: It's like a double edged sword here. They improved the FBT tracking which includes fixes for lying down and if my guess is correct that it's using different fixes which require that quick recalibration then this is something you don't currently want fixed because it could make lying down in FBT worse.",
