      "value": "@{5c1126e60289ad7789094976|full_name}: If I'm correct that its the different fixes from the open beta, you should be able to trigger this issue as well by starting in 6PT standing, turning off your trackers then go to lie down on the floor. It should put you into 3PT because last I read it was the hip would determine which fix they used as there were two distinct options during open beta. I can't test in vrchat for a bit so really I'm just guessing based on what I know from the open beta changes.",
