      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: As far as I'm aware I have tried this before and the game only puts you in FBT calibration when you hit calibrate, although I could be wrong. So you have to hit the calibrate button to go from 3pt -> 6pt, but going from 6pt -> 3pt is done automatically for some reason instead of also just clicking the button.",
