  "details": "Now, this is a case that probably isn't encountered much by most VR Chat users but it is one that affects me greatly. \n\nIf you are in 6pt tracking, and your trackers are off for whatever reason, moving your HMD height can snap your avatar from 6pt to 3pt tracking. This did not happen on previous builds.\n\nStreamable provides steps to reproduce and provides as reason as to why one would ever encounter this.\n\n\nhttps://streamable.com/nqgxn",
